{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b76eb05147d549f7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view with side-by-side and diff modes in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view with side-by-side and diff modes in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDelivers a run comparison surface in the Dashboard: users select two or more\n34\ttraining and pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by\n35\tside, with a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics\n36\tchanged between two selected runs. This is the core user-facing capability of\n37\tthe experiment-comparison strategy and the surface that the Model Registry\n38\tentry point and the documentation build on.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Multi-select of runs (training and pipeline) from a project's runs list in\n43\t  the Dashboard.\n44\t- A comparison view that renders each selected run's parameters and metrics\n45\t  side by side.\n46\t- A diff presentation within the same comparison view that highlights which\n47\t  parameters and metrics differ in value between two selected runs.\n48\t- Comparison of runs of mixed kinds (training and pipeline) in the same view.\n49\t- Comparison stays scoped to a single project; cross-project and\n50\t  cross-cluster comparison is out of scope per the strategy.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Given a project's runs list, when the user selects two or more runs, a\n55\t  comparison view opens showing each selected run's parameters and metrics\n56\t  side by side.\n57\t- Given two selected runs in the comparison view, the parameters and metrics\n58\t  whose values differ between the two runs are visually highlighted.\n59\t- Given completed Data Science Pipelines runs in the project, their\n60\t  parameters and metrics are included and render correctly in the comparison\n61\t  view (passive validation of Data Science Pipelines — no code change\n62\t  expected there).\n63\t- Given a selection mixing training runs and pipeline runs, both run kinds\n64\t  render in the same comparison view.\n65\t- All comparison interactions remain within a single project; no\n66\t  cross-project or cross-cluster selection is offered.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters\n71\t  and metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n72\t- HLR-3 (P1): provide a run \"diff\" view that highlights which parameters and\n73\t  metrics changed between two selected runs — consolidated with HLR-1 as a\n74\t  presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data;\n75\t  covered by this epic at its P0 priority.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9ca32c56ec3a971","agent_id":"afa95b92eeb68ab66","session_id":"3bd12ba6-3337-4052-a2c5-e0a73bbdce00","uuid":"73d97b9e-4101-4984-b844-cae3065fb1be","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:17:41.931Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b76eb05147d549f7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
