the response.\n53\t- Given model versions registered before this change (no run link present),\n54\t  those versions remain readable and valid through the API and UI.\n55\t- The link representation is defined such that a Dashboard surface can\n56\t  resolve the linked run within its project.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- HLR-2 (P1, registry half): registered model versions link back to the run\n61\t  that produced them.\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9ca32c56ec3a971","agent_id":"afa95b92eeb68ab66","session_id":"3bd12ba6-3337-4052-a2c5-e0a73bbdce00","uuid":"6aa9bb26-c67b-424c-9851-de9a10bba8ab","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:17:42.558Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-94f05beb7e173f2b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
