t  Model Registry UI offers an action that opens the run comparison view with\n54\t  that run included.\n55\t- Given a model version without a recorded run link, no broken or erroring\n56\t  entry point is rendered.\n57\t- The comparison opened from the Model Registry provides the same\n58\t  capabilities (side-by-side parameters and metrics, diff highlighting) and\n59\t  the same single-project scoping as the comparison opened from the runs\n60\t  list.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- HLR-2 (P1, UI half): a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry.\n65\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b9ca32c56ec3a971","agent_id":"afa95b92eeb68ab66","session_id":"3bd12ba6-3337-4052-a2c5-e0a73bbdce00","uuid":"12fbab55-2fd6-4c94-813d-72d893dc46f3","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:17:43.184Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-80c342f3650fedb3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
